section: compiler
synopsis: Fix the RISC-V NCG sign-extending MulMayOflo operands in place, corrupting live subword values
issues: #28131
mrs: !16999

description: {
  ``do_mul_may_oflo`` sign-extended its operands into their own registers. For
  subword widths this violated the zero-extended subword invariant when an
  operand was a local that remained live after the operation.

  The operands are now sign-extended into fresh registers, leaving the original
  values untouched.
}
